OL,3,GNEWSAMummified remains could return to
OL,4,AEgypt after removal from public view
OL,5,
OL,6,FRemains of an Egyptian mummy could be
OL,7,Freturned to Egypt after they were
OL,8,Fremoved from display over ethical
OL,9,Fconcerns.
OL,11,FThe Sunday Post newspaper reported
OL,12,F"Egyptian authorities" have asked for
OL,13,Fthe repatriation of the mummified
OL,14,Fcorpse of the priest Nekht, which was
OL,15,Ftaken out of public view at Kelvingrove
OL,16,FArt Gallery and Museum last month.
OL,18,FIt came after the International Council
OL,19,Fof Museums (Icom) revised its code of
OL,20,Fethics, recommending the "inherent
OL,21,Fdignity" of human remains be upheld.
OL,23,APub: 01-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,425,420,260,160,0,100
