OL,3,GNEWSAMummified remains could return to
OL,4,AEgypt after removal from public view
OL,5,
OL,6,FGlasgow Life, which operates the
OL,7,Fmuseum, confirmed it had received a
OL,8,Frequest to send the Nekht remains back
OL,9,Fto Egypt.
